Mk33 implements a training recipe that builds on the method described in AREX-2
(Qian et al., 2026, arXiv:2609.38288). The AREX-2 evaluation harness used for the
benchmarks in the paper is available from its authors at
https://github.com/VectorSpaceLab/AREX-2 and is not included here.
